# An object's identity is fixed at creation and (preference)

Standing user preference: An object's identity is fixed at creation and never changes; it can be thought of as the object's address in the Abyssal Zone (heap).

## Conventions
- An object's identity is fixed at creation and never changes; it can be thought of as the object's address in the Abyssal Zone (heap).

